    "text": "BY virtue of power vested on me under Section 66(C) read with Section 66(G) of Local Authorities Elections Ordinance amended by Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012, I, Adam Lebbe Mohamed Azmi, the Commissioner of Local Government of Eastern Province do hereby summon the meeting to \ufb01 ll the vacancy arose to the post of Vice Chairman of the Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha, Batticaloa District, Eastern Province at 10.00 a.m. on 29.08.2025 at Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha Hall for the purpose of elect the new Vice Chairman. A. L. M. A\u0d93\u0d86\u0d82, Commissioner of Local Government, Department of Local Government, Eastern Province.",
